{"seq":3,"slug":"sync-package-evolution","title":"sync 包演进与泛型化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/advanced/sync-package-evolution","wordCount":764,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"sync-包演进与泛型化\">sync 包演进与泛型化</h1><p>Go 的 <code>sync</code> 包自 1.0 起就是并发编程的基石——Mutex、WaitGroup、Once 陪伴了十余年。然而 <code>sync.Map</code> 和 <code>sync.Pool</code> 在泛型之前设计，被迫使用 <code>any</code> 类型，导致类型不安全与性能损耗。2025 年 Go 核心团队正式启动 <code>sync/v2</code> 提案，用泛型重构这些关键类型。本文梳理 sync 包从 v1 到 v2 的演进脉络，以及 Go 1.24 已落地的 Map 内部优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>sync 包的类型按演进阶段分为三层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>泛型化状态</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>已稳定（不变）</td>\n<td>Mutex, RWMutex, WaitGroup, Once, Cond</td>\n<td>无需泛型</td>\n<td>行为不涉及泛型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已泛型化（1.21+）</td>\n<td>OnceFunc, OnceValue[T], OnceValues[T1,T2]</td>\n<td>已 stable</td>\n<td>闭包捕获类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>待泛型化（sync/v2）</td>\n<td>Map[K,V], Pool[T]</td>\n<td>提案阶段</td>\n<td>解决 any 的安全/性能问题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"timeline\" data-source=\"timeline&#10;    title sync 包关键演进&#10;    2017 : sync.Map 引入 (Go 1.9) - any 类型&#10;    2022 : 泛型发布 (Go 1.18) - 基础设施就绪&#10;    2023 : OnceValue/OnceValues 泛型化 (Go 1.21)&#10;    2024 : Map 内部切换 HashTrieMap (Go 1.23+)&#10;    2025 : sync/v2 提案发布 (Map[K,V] Pool[T])&#10;    2026 : sync/v2 预计落地 (Go 1.25/1.26)\">timeline\n    title sync 包关键演进\n    2017 : sync.Map 引入 (Go 1.9) - any 类型\n    2022 : 泛型发布 (Go 1.18) - 基础设施就绪\n    2023 : OnceValue/OnceValues 泛型化 (Go 1.21)\n    2024 : Map 内部切换 HashTrieMap (Go 1.23+)\n    2025 : sync/v2 提案发布 (Map[K,V] Pool[T])\n    2026 : sync/v2 预计落地 (Go 1.25/1.26)</pre><h2 id=\"sync-map-v1-的问题\">sync.Map v1 的问题</h2><h3 id=\"类型不安全\">类型不安全</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"var m sync.Map&#10;m.Store(&quot;count&quot;, 42)&#10;&#10;// 编译通过但运行时 panic 或静默错误&#10;m.Store(&quot;count&quot;, &quot;not a number&quot;) // 类型混入&#10;v, _ := m.Load(&quot;count&quot;)&#10;num := v.(int) // 如果实际是 string → panic\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Map</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Store</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 编译通过但运行时 panic 或静默错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Store</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"not a number\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 类型混入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">v, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Load</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">num </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v.(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 如果实际是 string → panic</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"性能损耗\">性能损耗</h3><p>非指针值（如 string、int）转换为 <code>any</code> 接口时需要堆分配：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// string → any 需要分配接口头（16 字节）+ 字符串数据&#10;m.Store(&quot;key&quot;, &quot;short string&quot;) // 产生额外 alloc\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// string → any 需要分配接口头（16 字节）+ 字符串数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Store</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"short string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 产生额外 alloc</span></span></code></pre></div><p>基准测试（Go 1.24，读多写少场景）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>sync.Map (any)</th>\n<th>泛型 Map[string,int] (模拟)</th>\n<th>差距</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Load</td>\n<td>45ns</td>\n<td>28ns</td>\n<td>-38%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Store</td>\n<td>180ns</td>\n<td>95ns</td>\n<td>-47%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LoadOrStore</td>\n<td>210ns</td>\n<td>120ns</td>\n<td>-43%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"sync-v2-提案设计\">sync/v2 提案设计</h2><p>提案核心思路：在新包 <code>sync/v2</code> 中引入泛型版本，保留 v1 兼容性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"package sync // v2&#10;&#10;// Map 是并发安全的 map[K]V&#10;type Map[K comparable, V any] struct { /* ... */ }&#10;&#10;func (m *Map[K, V]) Load(key K) (value V, ok bool)&#10;func (m *Map[K, V]) Store(key K, value V)&#10;func (m *Map[K, V]) LoadOrStore(key K, value V) (actual V, loaded bool)&#10;func (m *Map[K, V]) LoadAndDelete(key K) (value V, loaded bool)&#10;func (m *Map[K, V]) Delete(key K)&#10;func (m *Map[K, V]) Swap(key K, value V) (previous V, loaded bool)&#10;func (m *Map[K, V]) CompareAndDelete(key K, old V)&#10;func (m *Map[K, V]) CompareAndSwap(key K, old, new V) (swapped bool)&#10;&#10;// Range 改为返回 iter.Seq2（与 iter 包集成）&#10;func (m *Map[K, V]) All() iter.Seq2[K, V]&#10;&#10;// Pool 泛型化&#10;type Pool[T any] struct {&#10;    New func() T&#10;}&#10;func (p *Pool[T]) Get() T&#10;func (p *Pool[T]) Put(x T)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">package</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sync</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Map 是并发安全的 map[K]V</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">K</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> comparable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">V</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* ... */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">K</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">V</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Load</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> K</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> V</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ok</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">K</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">V</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Store</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> K</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> V</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">K</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">V</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LoadOrStore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> K</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> V</span><span style=\"color:#242