-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> K</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">old</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> V</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">swapped</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Range 改为返回 iter.Seq2（与 iter 包集成）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">K</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">V</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">All</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">iter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Seq2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">K</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">V</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Pool 泛型化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Pool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">T</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    New </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Pool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Pool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键变更：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>Range</code> 方法替换为 <code>All()</code> 返回 <code>iter.Seq2[K,V]</code>——与 Go 1.24 的 iter 生态统一</li>\n<li>Pool 的 <code>Get</code> 返回 <code>T</code> 而非 <code>any</code>，消除类型断言</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"hashtriemap-底层实现升级\">HashTrieMap：底层实现升级</h2><p>Go 1.23 起，sync.Map 的内部实现从双 map（read map + dirty map）切换为 <strong>HashTrieMap</strong>——一种并发哈希字典树：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// internal/sync/hashtriemap.go&#10;// HashTrieMap 针对以下场景优化：&#10;// 1. 频繁读取（无锁快路径）&#10;// 2. 高并发写入不同 key（分段锁，互不干扰）&#10;// 3. 迭代一致性（无需全局锁）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// internal/sync/hashtriemap.go</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// HashTrieMap 针对以下场景优化：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1. 频繁读取（无锁快路径）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2. 高并发写入不同 key（分段锁，互不干扰）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 3. 迭代一致性（无需全局锁）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>与旧实现的对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>旧实现（read+dirty）</th>\n<th>HashTrieMap</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>读性能</td>\n<td>极好（read map 无锁）</td>\n<td>极好（CAS + 指针追踪）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写性能（不同 key）</td>\n<td>需要全局锁切换 dirty→read</td>\n<td>分段锁，可并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写性能（相同 key）</td>\n<td>直接原子更新 read map</td>\n<td>类似</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存效率</td>\n<td>两份 map 数据（dirty 是 read 的副本）</td>\n<td>单份前缀树</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迭代</td>\n<td>需要 promote dirty→read</td>\n<td>无锁快照遍历</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>社区基准测试（2026-03，forum.golangbridge.org）显示：在读多写少和均衡读写场景中，新 sync.Map 全面优于 RWMutex+map，包括曾被认为是其弱项的高写入场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践建议-何时用-sync-map-vs-mutex-map\">实践建议：何时用 sync.Map vs Mutex+map</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 推荐使用 sync.Map 的场景：&#10;// 1. key 集合增长型（如缓存，只增不删）&#10;// 2. 不同 goroutine 操作不同 key（disjoint key sets）&#10;// 3. 读远多于写（缓存命中率 &gt; 90%）&#10;&#10;// 仍推荐 Mutex+map 的场景：&#10;// 1. 需要原子化的多步操作（check-then-act）&#10;// 2. 需要 map 的全部操作（如 len()）&#10;// 3. 值类型复杂且需要在锁保护下修改\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 推荐使用 sync.Map 的场景：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1. key 集合增长型（如缓存，只增不删）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2. 不同 goroutine 操作不同 key（disjoint key sets）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 3. 读远多于写（缓存命中率 > 90%）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 仍推荐 Mutex+map 的场景：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1. 需要原子化的多步操作（check-then-act）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2. 需要 map 的全部操作（如 len()）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 3. 值类型复杂且需要在锁保护下修改</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"waitgroup-addanddone-go-1-24\">WaitGroup.AddAndDone (Go 1.24+)</h2><p>Go 1.24 为 WaitGroup 新增了 <code>AddAndDone</code> 方法的使用模式优化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// Go 1.24 example（官方文档风格）&#10;var wg sync.WaitGroup&#10;for range 5 {&#10;    wg.Add(1)&#10;    go func() {&#10;        defer wg.Done()&#10;        doWork()&#10;    }()&#10;}&#10;wg.Wait()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Go 1.24 example（官方文档风格）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wg </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WaitGroup</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    wg.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    go</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wg.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Done</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        doWork</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">wg.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Wait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"mutex-性能特征\">Mutex 性能特征</h2><p>Mutex 在 Go 1.24 中采用两阶段策略：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>自旋阶段</strong>：短暂自旋等待（在多核上有效减少上下文切换）</li>\n<li><strong>排队阶段</strong>：自旋超时后进入 FIFO 等待队列</li>\n<li><strong>饥饿模式</strong>：等待超过 1ms 的 goroutine 直接获得锁（Go 1.9+）</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// Mutex 饥饿模式触发条件&#10;const starvationThresholdNs = 1_000_000 // 1ms\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Mutex 饥饿模式触发条件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> starvationThresholdNs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1_000_000</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 1ms</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>sync/v2 用泛型解决 Map/Pool 的类型安全与性能损耗</li>\n<li>Map.All() 返回 iter.Seq2，与 Go 1.24 迭代器生态统一</li>\n<li>HashTrieMap 替代旧 read+dirty 实现，写入不同 key 时分段锁可并行</li>\n<li>Mutex 两阶段（自旋→排队）+ 饥饿模式保证公平性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"iter-range-over-func\">iter 迭代器与 Range-Over-Func</a>——sync/v2 Map.All() 的返回值类型 iter.Seq2 的完整语义与用法</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../go-service-engineering/project-structure/project-layout\">Go 服务工程 · 项目布局</a>——sync 包的选择（Map vs Mutex+map）直接影响数据层的设计方式</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"sync 包演进与泛型化","id":"sync-包演进与泛型化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"sync.Map v1 的问题","id":"sync-map-v1-的问题"},{"level":3,"text":"类型不安全","id":"类型不安全"},{"level":3,"text":"性能损耗","id":"性能损耗"},{"level":2,"text":"sync/v2 提案设计","id":"sync-v2-提案设计"},{"level":2,"text":"HashTrieMap：底层实现升级","id":"hashtriemap-底层实现升级"},{"level":2,"text":"实践建议：何时用 sync.Map vs Mutex+map","id":"实践建议-何时用-sync-map-vs-mutex-map"},{"level":2,"text":"WaitGroup.AddAndDone (Go 1.24+)","id":"waitgroup-addanddone-go-1-24"},{"level":2,"text":"Mutex 性能特征","id":"mutex-性能特征"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"iter 迭代器与 Range-Over-Func","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/advanced/iter-range-over-func"},"next":{"title":"结构化并发与 errgroup","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/practice/structured-concurrency"}}